[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_REGIONAL_DEVLOPMENT]
Return to the Sky

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C04_REGIONAL_DEVLOPMENT_desc]
The day will eventually come when the Wonderbolt flag will once again fly over Equestria, when every cloud and every rainbow will once again belong to us.
But before that, we must first keep ourselves alive — only by standing on solid clouds can we gather strength to leap and return to the sky.

[en.C04_state_group_btn_tooltip]
§C[C04GetCurrentStateGroupName]§!
Population(K): §Y[C04GetCurrentStateGroupPopulationDisplay]§!
Population Share: §Y[C04GetCurrentStateGroupPopulationRatioDisplay]§!
Economic Activity: §Y[C04GetCurrentStateGroupEconomicFactorDisplay]§!
Economic Score: §C[C04GetCurrentStateGroupEconomicScoreDisplay]§!
--------
National Economic Score: §C[?C04.VAR_TOTAL_ECONOMIC_SCORE|.0]§!
National Economic Score is calculated by multiplying the total population of each region (K) by the economic activity factor. For every §Ydoubling§! of the total economic score above §Y1000.0§!, the nation will gain §Yan additional 1.0 layer§! of bonus.
This means that the more total population the nation has and the higher the economic activity factor of each region, the more bonuses the nation will gain. The current bonus level is §C[?C04.VAR_ECONOMIC_LEVEL|.2]§!.

[en.C04_REGIONAL_DEV_DYNAMIC_MODIFIER]
Economic Activity Bonus

[en.C04_REGIONAL_DEV_DYNAMIC_MODIFIER_TOOLTIP]
For every §Ydoubling§! of the total economic score above §Y1000.0§!, the nation will gain §Yan additional 1.0 layer§! of bonus, including:
Monthly Population: [?C04.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_MONTHLY_POPULATION_BOOST_RATIO|=.1+%]
Weekly Stability: [?C04.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_STABILITY_WEEKLY_BOOST_RATIO|=.2+%]
Construction Speed: [?C04.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_CONSTRUCTION_BOOST_RATIO|=.1+%]
Factory Output: [?C04.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_FACTORY_BOOST_RATIO|=.1+%]
Resource Output: [?C04.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_RESOURCES_BOOST_RATIO|=.1+%]
Ethos Drift Defense: [?C04.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_DRIFT_DEFENCE_BOOST_RATIO|=.1+%]
Daily Political Power Gain: [?C04.VAR_REGIONAL_DEV_POLITICAL_POWER_BOOST_RATIO|=.2+]

--------------------------------------------
